; KrishMix EA4 - Adaptive Basket Exit  |  attach per traded symbol
;
; THE HAND-OFF RULE (InpRespectEntryTP) is the first thing to understand.
; EA1 sends its entry with a real target, e.g. 1:3. While that trade is still
; a single position riding that target, EA4 keeps its hands off it - otherwise
; the money floor below would close it for a dollar or two and the 1:3 would
; never get a chance. Basket management starts when EA2 opens the grid, or at
; InpManageFromLegs legs, whichever comes first.
;
; InpTargetPerLot is money asked per 1.00 lot of group volume, so the ask
; scales with the exposure carried:
;     0.05 lots -> $1.25    0.75 lots -> $18.75    2.00 lots -> $50
; Regime, volatility, depth and age then shape that number up or down.
;
; InpMinTarget is the floor and MUST stay above zero: EA4 only ever closes a
; group in profit, which is why no equity rule is needed anywhere.
;
; KEEP InpMagicBase IDENTICAL IN EVERY KrishMix EA.
InpMagicBase=51000
InpCommissionPerLot=0
InpSlippagePoints=40
InpRespectEntryTP=true
InpManageFromLegs=2
InpTargetPerLot=25
InpMinTarget=1
InpMaxTarget=0
InpTrendWithFactor=1.6
InpTrendAgainstFactor=0.6
InpRangeFactor=0.85
InpExhaustFactor=0.7
InpLowVolFactor=0.8
InpHighVolFactor=1.3
InpExtremeVolFactor=1.5
InpDepthReliefFrom=3
InpDepthReliefStep=0.92
InpAgeReliefPerHour=0.97
InpMinReliefFloor=0.15
InpCloseRecoveryGrp=true
InpCloseDirection=true
InpCloseWholeBook=true
InpWholeBookFactor=1.2
InpUseTrailing=false
InpTrailGiveback=0.35
InpStripTpWhenDeep=false
InpStripTpFromLegs=4
InpEmaFast=8
InpEmaSlow=21
InpEmaFilter=50
InpMtf1=15
InpMtf2=16385
InpAdxPeriod=14
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpDonchianPeriod=40
InpShowPanel=true
